// A file longer than 8192 bytes at the plate path is not the plate.
// The read ignores it and does not open it.
// The write replaces that file with the plate file.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE oversize ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law      ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG oversize law

IMPULSE oversize 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "oversize" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
